{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415345","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415345","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041534501:1":{"text":"……またこの季節がやって来たか。","source_cn":"……又到了这个季节。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x854E6261780900EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041534502:1":{"text":"寒く、暗く、瞬く間に消え去る氷雪ですら永久と化す……","source_cn":"寒冷，黑暗，连转瞬即逝的冰雪都足以化为永恒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A9E0F13300FE329","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041534503:1":{"text":"まさに我らグレイヴボーンの季節だ……そうは思わないか？","source_cn":"这是属于我等亡灵的日子……不是吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x999BC04A95486721","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041534504:1":{"text":"仰る通りでございます、陛下。長く安らかな静寂の死を享受できるのは、この時期だけでございますからねえ。","source_cn":"正是如此，陛下，这漫长与宁静的安详之死，唯有此时此刻才...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB42A3F05A22B70FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041534505:1":{"text":"それはそうと、お前のベビーたちとやらは冬眠をせぬのか？","source_cn":"说到这个，你的那些小宝贝们，不会冬眠吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED551D67CFCD36A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041534506:1":{"text":"もちろんでございます。魔法と集めた血肉で生み出した創造物に、そのような凡俗な――","source_cn":"这是通过魔法与血肉凝聚的造物，当然不会如凡俗之物那般——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84B182AAF6097D11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041534507:1":{"text":"……今のは、冗談ですか、陛下？","source_cn":"……不对，您刚刚是在开玩笑吗，陛下？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7DB3E1AAE2CFED3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041534508:1":{"text":"ふはっ……余以上にユーモアのない奴に出会ったのは久しぶりだ。","source_cn":"呵……我也是很久没有遇到比我更没有幽默感的家伙了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA70F0F2570B9F2C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041534509:1":{"text":"それも褒め言葉ではありませんよね、陛下？","source_cn":"我猜，这也不是一句夸奖吧，陛下？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CE54C88DEDEBAFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:托安":{"text":"トーラン","source":"托安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维珀里安":{"text":"ヴェパリアン","source":"维珀里安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":2}}